# Next.js + TypeScript

- Use the App Router (`app/`). Do not add `pages/` routes.
- Server Components by default. `"use client"` only for state, effects, or browser APIs.
- Route handlers live in `app/**/route.ts`.
- Prefer `next/link` and `next/image` over raw `<a>` / `<img>` for app navigation and images.
- Type props and function returns. Avoid `any` unless a one-line comment explains why.
- Colocate component-specific types next to the component; shared types go in `types/`.
